# text = That exactly in the ratio as they worked long and monotonously , the craving grew within them for some physical relief - some relaxation , encouraging good humour and good spirits , and giving them a vent - some recognized holiday , though it were but for an honest dance to a stirring band of music - some occasional light pie in which even M'Choakumchild had no finger - which craving must and would be satisfied aright , or must and would inevitably go wrong , until the laws of the Creation were repealed said Mr . Gradgrind Mr . Bounderby knew it was somewhere down town , but knew no more respecting it .
