# text = The question was unexpectedly and suddenly answered for her , by the colourless boy , Bitzer , who came round the corner with such blind speed and so little anticipating a stoppage on the pavement , that he brought himself up against Mr . Gradgrind's waistcoat and rebounded into the road said Mr . Gradgrind Bitzer picked up his cap , which the concussion had knocked off ; and backing , and knuckling his forehead , pleaded that it was an accident asked Mr . Gradgrind said the girl reluctantly cried Bitzer addressing Sissy Bitzer tried Mr . Bounderby with this said the girl cried Bitzer observed Mr . Bounderby returned his friend
