# text = This walk was common to all the male members of Sleary's company , and was understood to express , that they were always on horseback said Childers , giving his hair another shake , as he looked up from the empty box returned Mr . Gradgrind , approvingly said Mr . Gradgrind , rather resentfully , as having been defrauded of his good opinion . ' I was not aware of its being the custom to apprentice young persons to Mr . Bounderby put in with a loud laugh resumed Childers , feigning unconsciousness of Mr . Bounderby's existence Mr . E . W . B . Childers took one of his hands out of his pockets , stroked his face and chin , and looked , with a good deal of doubt and a little hope , at Mr . Gradgrind .
