# text = Tom had paused to find a sufficiently complimentary and expressive name for the parental roof , and seemed to relieve his mind for a moment by the strong alliteration of this one returned Tom , chafing his face on his coat-sleeve , as if to mortify his flesh , and have it in unison with his spirit said his sister , after silently watching the sparks awhile said Tom , desperately said Louisa , after another pause , and speaking thoughtfully out of her dark corner said Tom She came and kissed him , and went back into her corner again said Tom , spitefully setting his teeth said Tom , laughing Their shadows were defined upon the wall , but those of the high presses in the room were all blended together on the wall and on the ceiling , as if the brother and sister were overhung by a dark cavern .
