# text = Or , a fanciful imagination - if such treason could have been there - might have made it out to be the shadow of their subject , and of its lowering association with their future said Tom After waiting for some answering remark , and getting none , Tom wearily relapsed into the present time , and twined himself yawning round and about the rails of his chair , and rumpled his head more and more , until he suddenly looked up , and asked said Tom enquired his sister , slowly , and in a curious tone , as if she were reading what she asked in the fire , and it was not quite plainly written there returned Tom , pushing his chair from him , and standing up Louisa repeated in her former curious tone
