# text = Filled with these thoughts - so filled that he had an unwholesome sense of growing larger , of being placed in some new and diseased relation towards the objects among which he passed , of seeing the iris round every misty light turn red - he went home for shelter A CANDLE faintly burned in the window , to which the black ladder had often been raised for the sliding away of all that was most precious in this world to a striving wife and a brood of hungry babies ; and Stephen added to his other thoughts the stern reflection , that of all the casualties of this existence upon earth , not one was dealt out with so unequal a hand as Death .
