# text = The same great manufacturer , always with an immense variety of work on hand , in every stage of development , passed Sissy onward in his mill , and worked her up into a very pretty article indeed said Mr . Gradgrind Sissy answered with a curtsey said Mr . Gradgrind , knitting his brow , ' that the result of your probation there has disappointed me ; has greatly disappointed me .
