# text = Alas , for some one else thought James Harthouse , reversing the reflection of his first day's knowledge of her pretty face THE next morning was too bright a morning for sleep , and James Harthouse rose early , and sat in the pleasant bay window of his dressing-room , smoking the rare tobacco that had had so wholesome an influence on his young friend .
