# text = Remembrances of how she had journeyed to the little that she knew , by the enchanted roads of what she and millions of innocent creatures had hoped and imagined ; of how , first coming upon Reason through the tender light of Fancy , she had seen it a beneficent god , deferring to gods as great as itself ; not a grim Idol , cruel and cold , with its victims bound hand to foot , and its big dumb shape set up with a sightless stare , never to be moved by anything but so many calculated tons of leverage - what had she to do with these ?
