# text = He had been trying in vain , for half an hour , to read this newspaper , when the waiter appeared and said , at once mysteriously and apologetically A general recollection that this was the kind of thing the Police said to the swell mob , caused Mr . Harthouse to ask the waiter in return , with bristling indignation , what the Devil he meant by ' wanted Giving the waiter to the personage before mentioned , as a block - head duly qualified for that consignment , Mr . Harthouse hurried into the gallery .
