# text = Sissy had come there when it was already dark , to await her return from work ; and they had since sat at the window where Rachael had found her , wanting no brighter light to shine on their sorrowful talk pursued Rachael returned Sissy said Rachel , with a tremble in her voice said Rachael , ' and the kinder I feel it that you come away from there , purposely to comfort me , and keep me company , and be seen wi ' me when I am not yet free from all suspicion myself , the more grieved I am that I should ever have spoken those mistrusting words to the young lady .
