# text = But , caution being necessary in communicating with him - for there was a greater danger every moment of his being suspected now , and nobody could be sure at heart but that Mr . Bounderby himself , in a bullying vein of public zeal , might play a Roman part - it was consented that Sissy and Louisa should repair to the place in question , by a circuitous course , alone ; and that the unhappy father , setting forth in an opposite direction , should get round to the same bourne by another and wider route .
